title: Michael_Dialogue
---
Michael: ...Need something?
 -> I'm new to the area. Any tips?
        Michael: There's a rough looking rat looking for any excuse to pat us down. Try and stay away!
    -> Interested in some cheese?
        Michael: Hey! Careful saying that stuff like that aloud! There could be people listening, y'know!
        You: S-Sorry. Just trying to start my business.
        Michael: Crazy times to be getting into that business my friend. Is there anything else I can do for you?
            -> You sure you don't at least wanna try?
                Michael: Jeez you're persistant. Maybe I'll try a little of your supply.
                Michael: But I need you to do something for me first, okay?
                You: Alright, what do you need...?
                <<jump Michael_Favor_1_Intro>>
            -> Nah, nevermind...
            <<set_node Micheal_Met_1>>
        
===

title: Michael_Met_1
---

Michael: ...
    -> Think I want to try again.
        You: Got some good cheese, and I'll do anything to sell it.
        Michael: ...Anything? Ugh, alright. Maybe I'll try a little of your supply.
        Michael: But I need you to do something for me first, okay?
        You: Alright, what do you need...?
    -> See ya.
    
===


title: Michael_Favor_1_Intro
---

Michael: I lost py precious swiss army knife round here somewhere. Don't know if someone took it.
Michael: But if you found that, I'd owe ya. And possibly take a look at your supply.
    -> Sure, I got you!
        <<set_node Micheal_Favor_1_Mid>>
        Michael: Thanks bro!
        <<activate_favor>>
    -> No way...
        <<set_node Micheal_Met_1>>
    
===

title: Michael_Favor_1_Mid
---

Michael: Find that knife, and we'll talk business.
    
===

title: Michael_Favor_1_Done
---

Michael: Found it? Heck yeah! 
<<update_trust>>
<<activate_selling>>
Michael: Let's see what you've got...
<<set_node Michael_Favors_Comp>>
    
